{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "\u2708\ufe0fVelocity Wings\u2708\ufe0f",
    "steam_appid": 2597500,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hey pilot! Ready to de-stress? Buckle up... or actually, maybe don't bother!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine this: You're at the controls of a cute little plane, with no finish line ahead, no countdown timer, and no annoying enemy planes on your tail. <strong>Just you and the vast sky, having an eternal, relaxing &quot;date&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/95329251487493f11b95aed04f7d4a16.avif?t=1755100798\" width=184 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls? <strong>Just one finger is enough!</strong> Tap lightly to steer your little darling through graceful turns, climbs, and dives. No complex button combos, no hardcore flight sim, <strong>only pure, intuitive flying fun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A procedurally generated endless journey. <strong>Here, there's no failure, no Game Over, only free flight as you please.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of <strong>100 achievements</strong>. Earn a medal for every kilometer traveled! Only the truly persistent pilots will earn the <strong>gold-trimmed badge engraved</strong> with &quot;100KM!&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/59ac9a65d90bc0591903dfe05db20822.avif?t=1755100798\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forget the destination, embrace the journey itself.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Warning: First-time flight crash rate is a whopping 97%! (Unofficial data, but bragging rights guaranteed if you survive!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2328\ufe0f Keyboard Controls:</strong><br>\u2191 \u2193 \u2190 \u2192 - Movement<br><strong>SPACE</strong> - Boost<br><strong>ENTER</strong> - Pause</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Controller Controls:</strong><br><strong>Left Stick</strong> - Movement<br><strong>B</strong> - Boost<br><strong>A</strong> - Pause</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hey pilot! Ready to de-stress? Buckle up... or actually, maybe don't bother!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine this: You're at the controls of a cute little plane, with no finish line ahead, no countdown timer, and no annoying enemy planes on your tail. <strong>Just you and the vast sky, having an eternal, relaxing &quot;date&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/95329251487493f11b95aed04f7d4a16.avif?t=1755100798\" width=184 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls? <strong>Just one finger is enough!</strong> Tap lightly to steer your little darling through graceful turns, climbs, and dives. No complex button combos, no hardcore flight sim, <strong>only pure, intuitive flying fun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A procedurally generated endless journey. <strong>Here, there's no failure, no Game Over, only free flight as you please.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of <strong>100 achievements</strong>. Earn a medal for every kilometer traveled! Only the truly persistent pilots will earn the <strong>gold-trimmed badge engraved</strong> with &quot;100KM!&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/59ac9a65d90bc0591903dfe05db20822.avif?t=1755100798\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forget the destination, embrace the journey itself.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Warning: First-time flight crash rate is a whopping 97%! (Unofficial data, but bragging rights guaranteed if you survive!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2328\ufe0f Keyboard Controls:</strong><br>\u2191 \u2193 \u2190 \u2192 - Movement<br><strong>SPACE</strong> - Boost<br><strong>ENTER</strong> - Pause</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Controller Controls:</strong><br><strong>Left Stick</strong> - Movement<br><strong>B</strong> - Boost<br><strong>A</strong> - Pause</p>",
    "short_description": "Hey pilot! Ready to de-stress? Buckle up... or actually, maybe don\u2019t bother! Welcome to \u2708\ufe0fVelocity Wings\u2708\ufe0f\u2014an endless flight experience that\u2019ll leave your worries far below the clouds!",
